元件与成像</category></item><item><title>Infrared polymer boasts high index and transparency</title><link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41566-026-02033-8</link><description>Nature Photonics, Published online: 30 October 2026; doi:10.1038/s41566-026-02033-8 A bifunctional cyano-substitution synthetic strategy yields an all-organic polymer with a record-breaking refractive index of 2.53 at 750 nm, combining high infrared transparency with mechanical flexibility and solution-processability.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">e36336871cdc</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 18:00:40 GMT</pubDate><source>Nature Photonics</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>Low-voltage avalanche heterojunction phototransistor for infrared-to-visible upconversion</title><link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41566-026-02046-3</link><description>Nature Photonics, Published online: 30 October 2026; doi:10.1038/s41566-026-02046-3 Researchers demonstrate infrared-to-visible upconversion using an InGaAs/InP avalanche heterojunction phototransistor. Intrinsic positive feedback provides the photocurrent for amber LED operation, producing visible emission 17,000 times brighter than incident infrared light with a breakdown voltage as low as 1.4 V.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">65d2ef34eedc</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 18:00:40 GMT</pubDate><source>Nature Photonics</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>Q3净利暴跌87.44%！凤凰光学营收增长为何不赚钱？</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-11/ART-8100-2500-30709924.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">95e1ca763b8a</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 18:00:40 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>超快非线性光学技术之一百零六 深紫外超宽带瞬态吸收</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-11/ART-250007-11000-30709781.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">3ba21bdc88e4</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 18:00:40 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</sour